  "english_paragraphs": [
    "A: I've only had this phone for a week, and it's already broken. I want to return it!",
    "B: I'm very sorry for the inconvenience. But if you'd like to return or exchange it, I'll need to see your receipt and invoice first. Do you have them with you?",
    "A: Are these the two documents?",
    "B: Yes. Don't worry—our products generally don't have major problems. We can repair it for you.",
    "A: No, thanks. I'm very unhappy with this phone. I'm going to buy one from another company."
  ],
  "english_full": "A: I've only had this phone for a week, and it's already broken. I want to return it!\n\nB: I'm very sorry for the inconvenience. But if you'd like to return or exchange it, I'll need to see your receipt and invoice first. Do you have them with you?\n\nA: Are these the two documents?\n\nB: Yes. Don't worry—our products generally don't have major problems. We can repair it for you.\n\nA: No, thanks. I'm very unhappy with this phone. I'm going to buy one from another company.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "А: Я име́ю э́тот фо́н только до́лжай неде́ли, и он ужé сло́манный. Я хо́чу его́ верну́ть!",
    "Б: Мне о́чень жаль из-за неудо́бств. Но если вы́ хотите верну́ть или обменя́ть его́, мне не́обходимо уви́деть вашe получе́ние и счёт в пе́рвую о́чередь. У вас есть их с собо́й?",
    "А: Э́ти два докуме́нта?",
    "Б: Да. Не беспокойтесь — наша проду́кция вообще́ не име́ет серьёзных пробле́м. Мы мо́жем почи́нить его́ для вас.",
    "А: Нет, спасибо. Я о́чень несча́стен с э́тим фо́ном. Я собира́юсь купи́ть один из друго́й компа́нии."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "A: Ya iméyu étot fón tol'ko dólzhay nedéli, i on uzhé slómanny. Ya khóchu egó vernút'!",
    "B: Mne óchyen' zhal' iz-за neudóbstv. No esli vý khotite vernút' ili obmenyát' egó, mne néobkhodimo uvídet' vashe poluchéniye i schyot v pérvuyu óchered'. U vas yest' ikh s soboy?",
    "A: Éti dva dokumenta?",
    "B: Da. Ne bespokoites' — nasha prodúktsiya voóbshche ne iméyet seryóznykh probelém. My môzhem pochínit' egó dlya vas.",
    "A: Net, spasíbo. Ya óchyen' neschásten s étim fónom. Ya sobiráyus' kupít' odin iz drugóy kompánii."
  ],
